{"title":"Huge Collection of Laptop Sticker Art","link":"https://kottke.org/25/12/huge-collection-of-laptops-plastered-with-stickers","date":1765227122000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1045\" alt=\"Laptop stickers displaying Mozilla branding, vintage Apple logo, Firefox logo, and various tech company logos arranged on a light gray background.\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1003\" alt=\"Laptop sticker collage featuring tech and programming references including GitHub, Python, Bitcoin, Django, and Linux logos mixed with internet culture imagery.\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" alt=\"Black laptop covered with anti-Nazi and anti-fascist stickers including slogans, band logos, and political messaging.\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1074\" alt=\"Laptop sticker collection featuring gaming and tech references including Pac-Man, pixel art, Aperture Science, Dell, and various programming-related stickers.\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1164\" alt=\"Laptop covered with cybersecurity, hacking, and activist stickers including OWASP, Hack5, mountain-themed logos, and anti-surveillance messaging.\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-06.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-06.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-06.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" alt=\"Laptop stickers featuring music and entertainment brands including Pearl Jam, Adidas, Brainstorm, and various band and designer logos on dark background.\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-07.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-07.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-47974-07.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1126\" alt=\"Laptop sticker collection with pop culture imagery, band references, cassette tapes, and various meme and internet culture stickers in mixed styles.\" /></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://stickertop.art/\">Stickertop.art</a> is a massive collection of the tops of laptop computers adorned with stickers.</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>Laptop stickers are more than decoration, they’re a form of self-expression. Each one is a snapshot of a moment, a place, and an attitude. But they’re fleeting; when the technology becomes outdated, the laptops along with the stories stuck to them often end up in the waste pile. I thought it was a shame for something so personal and creative to just disappear, so I created this site to preserve them.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>If you’re a laptop decorator, <a href=\"https://stickertop.art/upload.php\">you can upload your sticker collection to the site</a>. (via <a href=\"https://mathstodon.xyz/@juandesant/115570134226250890#.\">@juandesant</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/computers\">computers</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/12/huge-collection-of-laptops-plastered-with-stickers\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"585886e8bb69435bb5b713dbfa6d9e1d7c435f43ec202357f3fa42b41f466a2a","category":"Sites"}